title: Deliver validator self-stake incentive as a hold, with maturation and self-stake bonding

doc:
- audience: Runtime Dev
  description: |-
    Validator self-stake incentive (issue #11876) is now delivered as a genuine lock-up: a
    `HoldReason::ValidatorIncentive` hold on `pallet-staking-async`'s own currency, instead of a
    liquid transfer. This replaces an earlier, abandoned `pallet-vesting`-based design whose
    freeze was silently masked whenever a validator's much larger `Staking` hold already covered
    the same funds, leaving the "locked" incentive fully spendable.

    AutoPay: at the end of each era, `auto_pay_incentive` pays every elected validator's earned
    incentive automatically, routed by their existing `RewardDestination`. Normal staker rewards
    paid via `payout_stakers` are unaffected.

    Maturation: delivered incentive is tracked per bonding-period bucket in `IdleIncentiveBuckets`
    (not-yet-bonded) and `BondedIncentiveBuckets` (bonded into self-stake), and matures linearly.
    Incentive delivered within the same bonding period merges into one bucket; a bucket is pruned
    once fully matured (idle side) or fully matured/slashed (bonded side).

    Unbonding gate: `unbond` now rejects any amount that would dip into still-restricted (unmatured)
    bonded incentive, returning `IncentiveStillRestricted`.

    Slashing: a slash scales all of a stash's bonded incentive buckets down by the same ratio
    `active` stake was just reduced. Idle (not-yet-bonded) incentive is never slashed.

    New extrinsics:
    - `release_incentive(target)`: releases `target`'s matured idle incentive from hold to `free`
    - `bond_incentive(amount)`: bonds `amount` of the caller's still-unmatured idle incentive into
      self-stake
    New events: `ValidatorIncentivePaid`, `ValidatorIncentiveReleased`, `IncentiveBonded`.
    New errors: `NoIncentiveToRelease`, `NoActiveEra`, `InsufficientIdleIncentive`,
    `IncentiveStillRestricted`, `TooManyIncentiveBuckets`.

crates:
- name: pallet-staking-async
  bump: major
- name: pallet-staking-async-parachain-runtime
  bump: minor
